{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4003_002chi", "source_sha256": "dc2079c667d0c884f184f26aa14deda62de950cae8cefd60c221b49bfed8c12a", "ja": "私も、呼んでもらえてよかったです。\n子どものために歌う歌……。", "zh": "我也很高兴能受到邀请。\n为了小孩子而唱的歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4004_002chi", "source_sha256": "7b303e713533ff165ee456e25cbcfd070c0908702770c1d7b6e56896d3fc34d0", "ja": "いつもと違う、新鮮な気持ちで歌えそうです。", "zh": "我似乎能带着不同于以往的新鲜感来歌唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4005_002chi", "source_sha256": "851ee7c09ed2fed90a9f4f2b37b3f33d7405353cb0d2430f05f191311ecd820b", "ja": "せっかくですから、今日はいつもとは違うジャンルの\n歌に挑戦してみようかと……。何がいいでしょう？", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我今天想挑战\n和往常不同类型的歌曲……你觉得什么比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4006_p", "source_sha256": "ec331e9e6ef0058a80a67b2b343ac7082dea425a578b6859374517316bbfb603", "ja": "そうだな。それじゃ……。", "zh": "这个嘛，那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4007", "source_sha256": "6fc6b870fb091464928b3a32040fe389d76d8fca5f84ef2a8fc8bb898584ba9f", "ja": "わらべ歌？", "zh": "童谣？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
