{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4100_p", "source_sha256": "02305d0cdab13be3e6790c17311b67d865f39767052f4216e2d6a618affe5c86", "ja": "わらべ歌とか、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "像是童谣之类的，应该不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4101_002chi", "source_sha256": "0a057bda4dc8f2fd46def8c1d433b7dc586b65f096b6dc6b0f07f7d6e8fd0aaf", "ja": "なるほど……。古くから伝わる歌詞とリズムには、\n子どもたちも関心を持ってくれそうです。", "zh": "原来如此……自古流传下来的歌词与旋律，\n那些小孩子应该也会感兴趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4102_002chi", "source_sha256": "4a5f68951c4ea9f190480a8bdd9d0fca1985851b7357610e1757b3bb2d76c031", "ja": "幼いうちから、歌の力を感じてもらえる……。\nそんなライブにできるかもしれません。ふふっ。", "zh": "让小孩子在年幼的时候，就感受到歌唱的力量……\n今天或许可以办一场这样的演唱会呢，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4200_p", "source_sha256": "f8338ba05022df4c6f733d1b1de5f9966149ddcf93be7eedb0e82a09cafc63b5", "ja": "子守唄で、会場を包み込むとか？", "zh": "以摇篮曲来抚慰会场如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4201_002chi", "source_sha256": "5ad9ac01211504920cd7172aa1b0b6cc37771015324fb9b8b856639d402f4e9b", "ja": "……いいかもしれません。寝かしつけてしまう危険は\nありますが、起きてさえいてくれれば……。", "zh": "……或许不错呢。虽然有让人睡着的危险，\n但只要观众能保持清醒，效果应该不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4202_002chi", "source_sha256": "08516651490533f7c4c1c78dd0b156c17e6b010b3d247c1945e6a53d0213fa6b", "ja": "アカペラでいけそうですから、今から考えてみます。", "zh": "这似乎能以清唱来演出，我现在就来思考如何表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4300_p", "source_sha256": "ab3e29bb6fe3b249e85cf298b8c7dd5688ec6612b97920349e5338b0a573199f", "ja": "へヴィメタルで魅せよう。\n千早のヘッドバンキング、俺も見てみたいし。", "zh": "用重金属音乐来抓住大家的心吧。\n而且我想看看千早甩头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_4301_002chi", "source_sha256": "e4c01fe4c942c4147c4bae664e4df9d9fb501a7b85d2100e923d17b8076154ad", "ja": "い、いえ、いつか歌ってみたいとは思いますが……。\n今日の子ども達は、望んでいないのでは？", "zh": "不、不对，我确实也想过有一天要挑战看看……\n但今天小孩子们应该不希望看到这种表演吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
